{"availability":"available","full":"swarina/llm-xray","name":"llm-xray","description":"See how an LLM works end to end - a live, faithful visualization of a real GPT-2's full forward pass, token by token, from tokenization to sampling.","category":"Education","language":"Python","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-06-15T16:33:23Z","updated":"2026-09-19T12:47:28Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://swarina-llm-xray.hf.space/","topics":["deep-learning","education","gpt-2","gradio","interpretability","llm","machine-learning","nlp","pytorch","transformers","visualization"],"demo":"https://swarina-llm-xray.hf.space/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T14:50:25.951Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T14:50:25.951Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T14:50:25.951Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T17:14:02.878Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-08T22:31:39.096Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-11T14:50:25.951Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Live demo: huggingface.co/spaces/swarina/llm-xray · deployment guide in DEPLOY.md (free Space - the first visit after it's idle takes 1 min to wake and load GPT-2)","This isn't a diagram of how language models work - it's the real machine, running. Load a real GPT-2 and watch it generate text one token at a time, with every stage of the forward pass exposed: tokens → embeddings → attention → feed-forward → layer-by-layer prediction → sampling → repeat. Every number on screen comes from the actual model. A detail control scales it from the full forward pass (detailed, the default) down to just \"watch it write\" (simple).","It began as a fact-check of the article How LLMs actually work and grew into a tool for seeing the pipeline instead of just reading about it."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/swarina/llm-xray/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"6680cc380b27554abb1e7d12a108fb5f487703b8c2c96cedc2816dfb2088ee7b","ex